<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Gill Sans MT"><b><font color="#f0f2f2">yes, we are on the way!</font></b></font></font>

29
00:01:21,870 --> 00:01:28,130
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="Gill Sans MT"><b><font color="#f0f2f2">I WANNA ROCKS mune ni ROCKS</font></b></font></font>

30
00:01:21,870 --> 00:01:28,130
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Gill Sans MT"><b><font color="#f0f2f2">I wanna rock... Rockin' my heart...</font></b></font></font>

31
00:01:51,790 --> 00:01:53,670
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It looks like you've got some time
to kill there all by yourself.</font>

32
00:01:55,880 --> 00:01:58,890
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What happened to the blond boy
and that stuck-up boy?</font>

33
00:01:59,390 --> 00:02:01,010
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">They're in the middle of
the tree-climbing training.</font>

34
00:02:01,510 --> 00:02:02,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You don't have to do that?</font>

35
00:02:03,350 --> 00:02:07,440
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm exceptional, so Kakashi-sensei
told me to guard you.</font>

36
00:02:09,810 --> 00:02:10,560
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Really?</font>

37
00:02:11,650 --> 00:02:12,980
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What?!</font>

38
00:02:15,030 --> 00:02:16,610
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You got a minute, Tazuna?</font>

39
00:02:17,780 --> 00:02:19,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huh? What's up, Giichi?</font>

40
00:02:20,030 --> 00:02:21,620
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Uh, actually...</font>

41
00:02:22,200 --> 00:02:24,120
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I gave it a lot of thought.</font>

42
00:02:24,580 --> 00:02:28,210
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Building this bridge...
will you let me quit?</font>

43
00:02:28,620 --> 00:02:32,420
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Why so suddenly? Not you too?!</font>

44
00:02:33,420 --> 00:02:36,550
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Tazuna, I've had a bond
with you from the old days.</font>

45
00:02:37,010 --> 00:02:39,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'd like to cooperate,
but if we push it too far,</font>

46
00:02:39,380 --> 00:02:41,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Gato will set his sights
on us, too.</font>

47
00:02:44,180 --> 00:02:48,140
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Also... if you get killed,
everything is lost!</font>

48
00:02:50,400 --> 00:02:54,150
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Why don't you just
stop building the bridge?</font>

49
00:02:59,030 --> 00:03:00,570
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Not a chance...</font>

50
00:03:02,450 --> 00:03:04,530
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This is our bridge.</font>

51
00:03:05,200 --> 00:03:08,250
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This is the bridge that
everyone in town has built</font>

52
00:03:08,290 --> 00:03:11,420
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">believing that it would generate
distribution and transportation</font>

53
00:03:11,500 --> 00:03:13,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">for this poor Land of Waves
that has few resources.</font>

54
00:03:14,460 --> 00:03:16,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But if it goes so far as
to take our lives...</font>

55
00:03:17,710 --> 00:03:19,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's already afternoon...</font>

56
00:03:19,470 --> 00:03:20,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Let's call it a day.</font>

57
00:03:23,090 --> 00:03:23,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Tazuna!</font>

58
00:03:25,850 --> 00:03:28,730
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Giichi... you don't have to
come back tomorrow.</font>

59
00:03:34,650 --> 00:03:40,610
<font face="Iwata Gyousho Pro-Kami B" size="45" color="#f5f5f5">The Country where</font>

60
00:03:34,650 --> 00:03:40,610
<font face="Iwata Gyousho Pro-Kami B" size="45" color="#f5f5f5">the Hero Existed</font>

61
00:03:41,900 --> 00:03:43,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Damn it!</font>

62
00:03:46,410 --> 00:03:48,410
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What the hell is up with this?</font>

63
00:04:05,300 --> 00:04:07,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I won't lose to you!</font>

64
00:04:23,610 --> 00:04:25,450
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Say, where are we going?</font>

65
00:04:25,700 --> 00:04:29,160
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I was asked to get some ingredients
for dinner on the way home...</font>

66
00:04:29,240 --> 00:04:31,660
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32"><b>{\an8}WILL DO ANY KIND OF WORK</b></font>

67
00:04:32,040 --> 00:04:33,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Thief!</font>

68
00:04:40,250 --> 00:04:41,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What's up with... this town...?</font>

69
00:04:43,340 --> 00:04:44,380
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We're here...</font>

70
00:04:45,430 --> 00:04:46,430
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Welcome...</font>

71
00:04:57,400 --> 00:04:59,070
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There's hardly anything here...</font>

72
00:05:05,700 --> 00:05:08,070
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You pervert!!</font>

73
00:05:08,990 --> 00:05:11,200
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You're... wrong...</font>

74
00:05:14,910 --> 00:05:17,580
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Man, I was really surprised earlier.</font>

75
00:05:18,000 --> 00:05:19,750
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What's going on with this town?!</font>

76
00:05:21,880 --> 00:05:22,590
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Again?</font>

77
00:05:23,710 --> 00:05:24,380
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey, you...</font>

78
00:05:28,390 --> 00:05:29,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What...?</font>

79
00:05:30,430 --> 00:05:31,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Gimme some!</font>

80
00:05:42,690 --> 00:05:44,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh... Here...</font>

81
00:05:46,030 --> 00:05:46,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yay!</font>

82
00:05:48,700 --> 00:05:49,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Thank you.</font>

83
00:05:55,410 --> 00:05:57,370
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This is how it's been ever
since Gato showed up.</font>

84
00:05:58,170 --> 00:06:01,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Here, all the adults
have turned into cowards.</font>

85
00:06:07,510 --> 00:06:11,180
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So that's why now
that bridge is necessary...</font>

86
00:06:12,050 --> 00:06:13,510
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's a symbol of bravery...</font>

87
00:06:14,140 --> 00:06:17,180
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">in order to restore their spirit,
so they don't keep running away...</font>

88
00:06:17,270 --> 00:06:18,730
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">For the people of this land...</font>

89
00:06:18,810 --> 00:06:20,770
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">who have set their minds
on remaining passive...</font>

90
00:06:23,770 --> 00:06:28,530
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If we can just...
complete that bridge...</font>

91
00:06:30,820 --> 00:06:33,370
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">this town will return to
how it once was...</font>

92
00:06:34,540 --> 00:06:36,410
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">and everyone will come back.</font>

93
00:06:45,840 --> 00:06:47,920
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sasuke-kun... Naruto...</font>

94
00:07:05,570 --> 00:07:06,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Damn it! Damn it!</font>

95
00:07:07,110 --> 00:07:09,530
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Are you telling me that
Sasuke's still climbing?!</font>

96
00:07:14,370 --> 00:07:15,030
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Damn it...</font>

97
00:07:15,280 --> 00:07:16,910
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He's gradually catching up...</font>

98
00:07:19,460 --> 00:07:22,710
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Damn it! No! No!</font>

99
00:07:23,330 --> 00:07:27,250
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If I let myself get distracted by Sasuke,
my concentration will be disturbed!</font>

100
00:07:29,470 --> 00:07:33,180
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey Sakura,
can you give me some tips?</font>

101
00:07:33,680 --> 00:07:34,350
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huh?</font>

102
00:07:34,890 --> 00:07:37,100
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Without telling Sasuke, okay, okay?</font>

103
00:07:38,810 --> 00:07:39,600
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Listen.</font>

104
00:07:39,680 --> 00:07:44,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Chakra uses spiritual energy,
so you mustn't get too strained or frantic.</font>

105
00:07:45,360 --> 00:07:48,530
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Relax and concentrate on the tree
so that you can constantly accumulate</font>

106
00:07:48,610 --> 00:07:50,950
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">a fixed amount of Chakra
in the bottom of your feet.</font>

107
00:07:51,780 --> 00:07:53,490
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Concentrate!
Concentrate!</font>

108
00:07:53,780 --> 00:07:56,330
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Okay. I'm feeling pretty good right now!</font>

109
00:07:56,910 --> 00:07:58,490
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Okay! This is it!</font>

110
00:07:58,580 --> 00:07:59,290
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey... Naruto!</font>

111
00:08:01,830 --> 00:08:04,540
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Jeez, what the hell's
wrong with you?!</font>

112
00:08:04,790 --> 00:08:06,750
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Don't interfere while
I'm trying to concentrate!</font>

113
00:08:07,500 --> 00:08:10,340
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">U... Uh... Well...</font>

114
00:08:11,300 --> 00:08:12,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">W-What is it?!</font>

115
00:08:14,470 --> 00:08:17,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm not used to
him speaking to me first...</font>

116
00:08:20,350 --> 00:08:24,350
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Y-You asked Sakura to give
you some tips before...</font>

117
00:08:24,980 --> 00:08:26,690
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What did she say to you...?</font>

118
00:08:31,320 --> 00:08:32,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm not telling!</font>

119
00:08:48,670 --> 00:08:49,670
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Man...</font>

120
00:08:49,710 --> 00:08:51,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This is really fun!</font>

121
00:08:51,340 --> 00:08:54,590
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's been a long time since we've had
a meal with this many people!</font>

122
00:09:01,270 --> 00:09:02,180
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Seconds please!</font>

123
00:09:08,110 --> 00:09:10,320
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Stop eating if you're going to vomit!</font>

124
00:09:10,780 --> 00:09:12,280
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No, I'll eat.</font>

125
00:09:13,110 --> 00:09:15,030
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I have to eat even
if it means enduring.</font>

126
00:09:15,450 --> 00:09:17,950
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I have to get strong
as quickly as possible, so...</font>

127
00:09:18,740 --> 00:09:19,740
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yes, yes!</font>

128
00:09:20,370 --> 00:09:22,750
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But vomiting is different.</font>

129
00:09:29,250 --> 00:09:33,210
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Excuse me, why is there
a torn picture hanging here?</font>

130
00:09:34,130 --> 00:09:37,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Inari-kun was looking at this
all through dinner.</font>

131
00:09:37,180 --> 00:09:42,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This torn part looks like someone who was
in the picture was deliberately torn off.</font>

132
00:09:47,520 --> 00:09:48,480
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's my husband...</font>

133
00:09:50,820 --> 00:09:53,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He's a man who was
once called a hero of this town...</font>

134
00:09:57,530 --> 00:09:59,160
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Inari! Where are you going...?</font>

135
00:10:06,540 --> 00:10:07,330
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Dad!</font>

136
00:10:07,580 --> 00:10:10,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm always telling you not to
talk about that person in front of Inari...!</font>

137
00:10:21,850 --> 00:10:24,520
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What're you saying happened with Inari-kun?</font>

138
00:10:25,520 --> 00:10:28,310
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It appears there's
some kind of good reason.</font>

139
00:10:29,980 --> 00:10:33,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Inari had a father
not related by blood...</font>

140
00:10:34,190 --> 00:10:37,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It was like they were a real father
and son who got along really well...</font>

141
00:10:40,660 --> 00:10:44,330
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Back then, Inari was a child
who laughed all the time...</font>

142
00:10:46,370 --> 00:10:47,200
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">However...</font>

143
00:10:54,130 --> 00:10:55,210
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">However...</font>

144
00:10:56,630 --> 00:11:02,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Inari has changed...
ever since that incident with his father.</font>

145
00:11:06,890 --> 00:11:09,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The word bravery was eternally taken</font>

146
00:11:09,480 --> 00:11:13,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">from the people of this island
and from Inari...</font>

147
00:11:14,360 --> 00:11:17,190
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">With that day,
that incident, as the trigger.</font>

148
00:11:18,280 --> 00:11:21,280
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That incident?
What happened to Inari-kun?</font>

149
00:11:22,620 --> 00:11:25,490
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">To explain the incident,
I must first...</font>

150
00:11:26,290 --> 00:11:30,710
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">tell you about the man
who was called the hero of this land.</font>

151
00:11:31,250 --> 00:11:32,210
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hero...?</font>

152
00:11:33,130 --> 00:11:35,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It was around three years ago...</font>

153
00:11:35,710 --> 00:11:38,210
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">when Inari met the man...</font>

154
00:11:41,090 --> 00:11:43,030
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Potchi!!
Potchi!!</font>

155
00:11:45,510 --> 00:11:46,310
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Wrong!</font>

156
00:11:46,720 --> 00:11:48,930
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">His name's Shooting Star...</font>

157
00:11:49,350 --> 00:11:50,890
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">As of today, he's my dog!</font>

158
00:11:51,140 --> 00:11:54,480
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He's not Shooting Star!
He's my Potchi! Give him back!</font>

159
00:11:54,900 --> 00:11:56,440
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Potchi's my friend!</font>

160
00:11:56,690 --> 00:11:58,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Who's going to give him
to the likes of you?!</font>

161
00:12:00,900 --> 00:12:01,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Shut up!</font>

162
00:12:08,700 --> 00:12:09,450
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Potchi!!</font>

163
00:12:13,290 --> 00:12:15,670
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's cuz you wouldn't
hand him over quietly...</font>

164
00:12:16,130 --> 00:12:18,210
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Now I couldn't care less
about that dog!</font>

165
00:12:19,130 --> 00:12:20,550
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey, let him go!</font>

166
00:12:22,130 --> 00:12:25,300
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What have you done?!
Are you trying to kill Potchi?!</font>

167
00:12:25,930 --> 00:12:28,890
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Heh! He's your special mutt, right?</font>

168
00:12:29,180 --> 00:12:30,980
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Then save him, quick.</font>

169
00:12:33,190 --> 00:12:34,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What's the matter...?</font>

170
00:12:35,270 --> 00:12:36,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Is it okay with you if he dies?!</font>

171
00:12:44,110 --> 00:12:45,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Of course I'm not okay
with him dying!</font>

172
00:12:46,030 --> 00:12:48,740
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He's my only friend!</font>

173
00:12:49,660 --> 00:12:51,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— But...
— Look. He can't even dog paddle</font>

174
00:12:51,540 --> 00:12:53,830
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— even though he's a dog!
— But...</font>

175
00:12:54,160 --> 00:12:57,960
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm sorry, Potchi...
I can't swim...</font>

176
00:12:58,960 --> 00:13:02,130
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey! If you're his owner,
dive in after him!</font>

177
00:13:09,260 --> 00:13:13,180
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This is bad, Akane-san.
What if he can't swim...?</font>

178
00:13:15,390 --> 00:13:16,350
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">S-Save me...!</font>

179
00:13:16,900 --> 00:13:17,600
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Leave him be.</font>

180
00:13:18,520 --> 00:13:19,190
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">B-But...</font>

181
00:13:20,900 --> 00:13:23,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Then why don't you go
save him if you like?</font>

182
00:13:26,360 --> 00:13:29,120
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I-I don't want to die...
Somebody save me...!</font>

183
00:13:32,240 --> 00:13:33,160
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">P-Potchi!</font>

184
00:13:34,710 --> 00:13:35,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Potchi!</font>

185
00:13:36,290 --> 00:13:37,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm gonna digress, but...</font>

186
00:13:38,670 --> 00:13:41,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Potchi learned
how to dog paddle then.</font>

187
00:13:44,970 --> 00:13:46,340
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Potchi!</font>

188
00:13:53,600 --> 00:13:55,600
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Shooting Star escaped. Get him!</font>

189
00:14:07,200 --> 00:14:11,200
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh... I can't breathe...
This... is it...</font>

190
00:14:18,460 --> 00:14:20,080
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Are you awake, boy?</font>

191
00:14:25,510 --> 00:14:28,630
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I gave those kids
a good scolding.</font>

192
00:14:29,340 --> 00:14:30,510
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Here, eat!</font>

193
00:14:32,050 --> 00:14:34,220
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Is this God? Oh...</font>

194
00:14:34,720 --> 00:14:36,810
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Did you... save me?</font>

195
00:14:37,600 --> 00:14:40,690
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Just eat! Start with that.</font>

196
00:14:42,820 --> 00:14:45,440
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I see. You were betrayed
by your dog, too...</font>

197
00:14:46,190 --> 00:14:50,110
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">In my country, dogs are creatures
that have a keen sense of loyalty...</font>

198
00:14:50,700 --> 00:14:53,660
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Well, you betrayed
your dog's trust first,</font>

199
00:14:53,700 --> 00:14:55,200
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">so there's nothing
you can do about that.</font>

200
00:14:56,910 --> 00:14:59,620
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I was scared and couldn't move.</font>

201
00:15:02,290 --> 00:15:03,960
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I wanted to save him...</font>

202
00:15:04,420 --> 00:15:07,130
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But... I have no guts, so...</font>

203
00:15:07,420 --> 00:15:08,550
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's right.</font>

204
00:15:09,800 --> 00:15:12,850
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Of course a kid your age
would be scared.</font>

205
00:15:14,510 --> 00:15:15,640
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But you know... boy.</font>

206
00:15:16,390 --> 00:15:18,100
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Just remember this.</font>

207
00:15:18,600 --> 00:15:19,270
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huh?</font>

208
00:15:20,100 --> 00:15:22,940
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If you're a man choose
a lifestyle you won't regret...</font>

209
00:15:25,070 --> 00:15:27,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">For things I truly
hold dear to myself,</font>

210
00:15:28,030 --> 00:15:31,280
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'll protect them until the very end
with both these arms.</font>

211
00:15:31,490 --> 00:15:34,490
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Even if it's tough, or sad,
I'll stick it out...</font>

212
00:15:34,580 --> 00:15:37,240
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">even if it looks like
I might lose my life!</font>

213
00:15:41,710 --> 00:15:43,290
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">His name was Kaiza and</font>

214
00:15:43,630 --> 00:15:48,130
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">he was a fisherman who'd come to this land
from another country in search of his dreams.</font>

215
00:15:49,010 --> 00:15:52,180
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">After that, Inari really took to Kaiza.</font>

216
00:15:52,590 --> 00:15:55,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It may have been because Inari
had lost his real father</font>

217
00:15:55,800 --> 00:15:57,850
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">when he was too young
to remember anything.</font>

218
00:15:58,100 --> 00:16:01,100
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But he was very attached to Kaiza.</font>

219
00:16:01,190 --> 00:16:02,600
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">They were like father and son...</font>

220
00:16:04,480 --> 00:16:07,270
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It didn't take long
for Kaiza to become...</font>

221
00:16:07,690 --> 00:16:09,690
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">a member of the family.</font>

222
00:16:11,780 --> 00:16:15,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And he was a man
this town needed.</font>

223
00:16:16,530 --> 00:16:18,490
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We... we've got trouble, Kaiza-san!</font>

224
00:16:18,580 --> 00:16:20,830
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The river dam has broken
from this rain!</font>

225
00:16:21,080 --> 00:16:23,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">At this rate,
District D will be consumed!</font>

226
00:16:23,790 --> 00:16:25,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— What?!
— Dad!</font>

227
00:16:25,670 --> 00:16:27,630
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Inari, go out back and
get some rope!</font>

228
00:16:27,670 --> 00:16:28,340
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Okay!</font>

229
00:16:29,090 --> 00:16:29,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Its no good!</font>

230
00:16:29,960 --> 00:16:31,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The only thing we can do is
to attach a rope and pull...</font>

231
00:16:32,260 --> 00:16:34,840
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Don't talk nonsense!
How are we going to attach a rope?!</font>

232
00:16:35,090 --> 00:16:37,930
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We'd die if we were to go
into such a furious current!</font>

233
00:16:38,180 --> 00:16:40,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But if we drag our feet,
District D will be annihilated!</font>

234
00:16:41,350 --> 00:16:42,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What should we do...?</font>

235
00:16:42,890 --> 00:16:43,600
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'll do it.</font>

236
00:16:46,360 --> 00:16:47,060
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Kaiza!</font>

237
00:16:47,560 --> 00:16:48,770
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Don't be foolish!</font>

238
00:16:49,070 --> 00:16:50,730
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Even you wouldn't be able to!</font>

239
00:16:51,530 --> 00:16:52,190
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Dad!</font>

240
00:16:52,820 --> 00:16:54,070
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Don't worry...</font>

241
00:16:54,860 --> 00:16:56,240
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Your dad's unmatched.</font>

242
00:16:56,870 --> 00:17:00,620
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Your dad loves the town
you're from, so...</font>

243
00:17:04,710 --> 00:17:07,460
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">For things I truly hold dear to myself...</font>

244
00:17:16,090 --> 00:17:18,220
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Even if I lose my life...</font>

245
00:17:21,390 --> 00:17:24,310
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'll protect them to the end...
with both these arms!</font>

246
00:17:26,440 --> 00:17:28,810
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Dad, hang in there!</font>

247
00:17:36,410 --> 00:17:39,410
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He did it!
The rope... the rope's attached!</font>

248
00:17:39,490 --> 00:17:41,370
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Okay, everybody pull!</font>

249
00:17:41,450 --> 00:17:42,490
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yeah!</font>

250
00:17:43,410 --> 00:17:47,750
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">From then on... the people of this land
called Kaiza a hero.</font>

251
00:17:47,790 --> 00:17:52,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And he became a father
that Inari could be proud of.</font>

252
00:17:53,630 --> 00:17:57,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It was around that time when Gato
set his sights on this land.</font>

253
00:17:57,550 --> 00:18:00,100
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And then, one night...</font>

254
00:18:14,280 --> 00:18:15,530
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I heard...</font>

255
00:18:15,740 --> 00:18:18,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That you're going to protect
this town with those arms...</font>

256
00:18:26,250 --> 00:18:28,330
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I dare you to!</font>

257
00:18:59,150 --> 00:19:00,160
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Listen up!</font>

258
00:19:00,490 --> 00:19:04,830
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This man resisted through force,
the policies of the Gato corporation</font>

259
00:19:04,870 --> 00:19:07,040
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">and disturbed the order
of this nation.</font>

260
00:19:08,160 --> 00:19:10,330
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Therefore, he will now be executed!</font>

261
00:19:16,920 --> 00:19:21,220
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I just hope that such trivial matters
will never occur again.</font>

262
00:19:21,590 --> 00:19:22,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Dad!</font>

263
00:19:22,970 --> 00:19:24,180
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Stop, Inari...</font>

264
00:19:32,310 --> 00:19:33,060
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Do it...</font>

265
00:19:37,320 --> 00:19:38,070
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Dad...</font>

266
00:19:44,370 --> 00:19:45,910
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Dad!</font>

267
00:19:54,290 --> 00:19:55,840
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Didn't you tell me...?</font>

268
00:19:59,800 --> 00:20:02,840
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That you'd... protect...</font>

269
00:20:07,350 --> 00:20:11,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">me and the people of this land...
with both your arms...?</font>

270
00:20:12,770 --> 00:20:15,020
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Dad, you liar...</font>

271
00:20:19,190 --> 00:20:22,450
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Ever since then,
Inari has changed...</font>

272
00:20:23,200 --> 00:20:25,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">as well as Tsunami...
and the townspeople...</font>

273
00:20:29,870 --> 00:20:34,290
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hero, that's just stupid.
There's no such thing!</font>

274
00:20:52,270 --> 00:20:54,060
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What're you doing, Naruto...?</font>

275
00:20:54,440 --> 00:20:58,020
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You've had enough training for today.
You've built up too much Chakra.</font>

276
00:20:58,440 --> 00:21:00,030
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You'll die if you move
any more than that.</font>

277
00:21:01,360 --> 00:21:02,690
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'll prove it.</font>

278
00:21:04,490 --> 00:21:05,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Prove what?</font>

279
00:21:08,070 --> 00:21:09,120
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'll prove that...</font>

280
00:21:09,660 --> 00:21:12,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">there are heroes...</font>

281
00:21:16,040 --> 00:21:17,210
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">in this world!</font>

282
00:21:33,410 --> 00:21:36,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Dubai"><font size="40"><b><font color="#e8e6bc">Cultivate your hunger before you idealize.</font></b></font></font></font>

283
00:21:36,790 --> 00:21:40,250
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Dubai"><font size="40"><b><font color="#e8e6bc">Motivate your anger to make them all realize.</font></b></font></font></font>

284
00:21:40,250 --> 00:21:43,420
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Dubai"><font size="40"><b><font color="#e8e6bc">Climbing the mountain, never coming down.</font></b></font></font></font>

285
00:21:43,420 --> 00:21:47,180
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Dubai"><font size="40"><b><font color="#e8e6bc">Break into the contents, never falling down.</font></b></font></font></font>

286
00:21:50,600 --> 00:21:53,850
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Dubai"><font size="40"><b><font color="#e8e6bc">My knee is still shaking, like I was twelve.</font></b></font></font></font>

287
00:21:53,850 --> 00:21:57,190
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Dubai"><font size="40"><b><font color="#e8e6bc">Sneaking out of the classroom, by the back door.</font></b></font></font></font>

288
00:21:57,190 --> 00:22:00,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Dubai"><font size="40"><b><font color="#e8e6bc">A man railed at me twice though, but I didn't care.</font></b></font></font></font>

289
00:22:00,650 --> 00:22:04,320
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Dubai"><font size="40"><b><font color="#e8e6bc">Waiting is wasting for people like me.</font></b></font></font></font>

290
00:22:04,320 --> 00:22:07,320
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Dubai"><font size="40"><b><font color="#e8e6bc">Don't try to look so wise.</font></b></font></font></font>

291
00:22:07,320 --> 00:22:10,780
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Dubai"><font size="40"><b><font color="#e8e6bc">Don't cry 'cause you're so right.</font></b></font></font></font>

292
00:22:10,780 --> 00:22:14,370
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Dubai"><font size="40"><b><font color="#e8e6bc">Don't dry with fakes or fears,</font></b></font></font></font>

293
00:22:14,370 --> 00:22:18,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Dubai"><font size="40"><b><font color="#e8e6bc">'Cause you will hate yourself in the end.</font></b></font></font></font>

294
00:22:27,340 --> 00:22:30,680
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Dubai"><font size="40"><b><font color="#dfe9ed">Don't try to look so wise.</font></b></font></font></font>

295
00:22:30,680 --> 00:22:34,060
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Dubai"><font size="40"><b><font color="#dfe9ed">Don't cry 'cause you're so right.</font></b></font></font></font>

296
00:22:34,060 --> 00:22:37,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Dubai"><font size="40"><b><font color="#dfe9ed">Don't dry with fakes or fears,</font></b></font></font></font>

297
00:22:37,390 --> 00:22:41,020
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Dubai"><font size="40"><b><font color="#dfe9ed">'Cause you will hate yourself in the end.</font></b></font></font></font>

298
00:22:41,020 --> 00:22:44,480
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Dubai"><font size="40"><b><font color="#dfe9ed">Don't try to look so wise.</font></b></font></font></font>

299
00:22:44,480 --> 00:22:47,780
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Dubai"><font size="40"><b><font color="#dfe9ed">Don't cry 'cause you're so right.</font></b></font></font></font>

300
00:22:47,780 --> 00:22:50,030
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Dubai"><font size="40"><b><font color="#dfe9ed">Don't dry...</font></b></font></font></font>

301
00:22:52,680 --> 00:22:54,850
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">Huh? What do you want, lady?</font>

302
00:22:55,220 --> 00:22:56,600
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">As for me, I'm training right now.</font>

303
00:22:56,680 --> 00:22:58,810
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">Cuz we don't know when
Zabuza will strike next...</font>

304
00:22:59,520 --> 00:23:02,690
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">Getting strong for someone special
is something I understand very well.</font>

305
00:23:02,900 --> 00:23:05,480
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">So I'm going to get
stronger and stronger.</font>

306
00:23:06,110 --> 00:23:09,240
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">I'll show Inari that there are heroes
in this world.</font>

307
00:23:10,570 --> 00:23:13,830
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">Next time:
"Decisive Battle on the Bridge! Zabuza Returns!!"</font>

308
00:23:13,910 --> 00:23:16,540
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">As for me, I'm going to
kick butt once again!</font>

